requirement SYS-ALARM-001
title: Issue high-water alarm
statement:
  The service shall issue a high-water alarm within 2 seconds after detecting the configured threshold crossing.
safety-assessment: SA-001 | WMSCS-r1 | 87effc4736bf5501c969c3fe52e133e724292688497e2946041e1ba1374eef2b | uncrewed-rural | SC1 | project-safety-authority | hazard-analysis.git@a014c2e#HAZ-004 | Alarm supports operator response but is not credited as the sole protective control.
safety-assessment: SA-002 | WMSCS-r1 | 87effc4736bf5501c969c3fe52e133e724292688497e2946041e1ba1374eef2b | potable-water-control | SC2 | project-safety-authority | hazard-analysis.git@b729a30#HAZ-017 | Revised analysis credits the alarm as a required control against unsafe untreated-water routing.
end requirement

requirement SENSOR-LEVEL-001
title: Measure water level
statement:
  The level-sensing unit shall provide a water-level measurement at least once per second.
decomposes: SYS-ALARM-001
safety-assessment: SA-003 | WMSCS-r1 | 87effc4736bf5501c969c3fe52e133e724292688497e2946041e1ba1374eef2b | uncrewed-rural | SC1 | project-safety-authority | hazard-analysis.git@a014c2e#HAZ-004 | Measurement supports high-water detection.
end requirement

requirement COMMS-REMOTE-001
title: Transmit remote alarm
statement:
  The communications unit shall transmit each high-water alarm to the configured remote endpoint.
decomposes: SYS-ALARM-001
safety-assessment: SA-004 | WMSCS-r1 | 87effc4736bf5501c969c3fe52e133e724292688497e2946041e1ba1374eef2b | uncrewed-rural | SC0 | project-safety-authority | hazard-analysis.git@a014c2e#HAZ-004 | Remote notification is operationally useful but not credited in this context.
end requirement
